    "",
    "Recorded BY HAND from what the page presents to a shopper: each button in the",
    "'Select size' section, its visible label and its aria-label price text, e.g.",
    "  aria-label=\"1 gallon - Price $45.95\"",
    "  aria-label=\"1 quart - Original price $35.95, sale price $30.95 - 14% OFF\"",
    "Independently corroborated against the page's schema.org Product/Offer block:",
    "every listed sale price matched exactly ONE non-pack Offer sku, and every one",
    "of those Offers is https://schema.org/InStock. Buttons in the separate",
    "'Select quantity' section (Single / N-Pack) are NOT sizes and are excluded.",
    "",
    "NOTHING in this file came from scrapers/shopify.py. It is the baseline the",
    "parser is measured against, never the other way round."
